      "bodyPoint2": {
        "heading": "2. Boosting Focus and Productivity (Nâng cao khả năng tập trung & năng suất)",
        "detail": "Instrumental tracks, Lo-fi beats, or nature sounds block noisy backgrounds and create deep study flow.",
        "example": "Students who listen to lyric-free music while doing math or writing reports finish tasks faster with fewer mistakes."
      },
      "conclusionSummary": "In conclusion, music is not just entertainment; it is free, powerful medicine for our mental well-being and brain power.",
